stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Journal: restored unfinished_handoff, front queued
    Journal --> Dropped: channel left Herdr AND old pane ended / drop journal, keep front
    Dropped --> Submitted: ordinary path reserves the front once
    Journal --> Backoff: channel left Herdr unended, or mapped host refuses an ended journal / persist failures + deadline
    Backoff --> Journal: 2,4,8,16 seconds / timer wake
    Journal --> Retained: fifth counted hold / original + notice intent, journal released
    Retained --> NextHead: next front takes the ordinary path
    Journal --> Custody: mapped host refuses, old pane standing / count as a close failure
    Custody --> Journal: backoff up to 32 seconds
    Journal --> Closing: mapped channel, Herdr host / close old pane first
    Closing --> Submitted: ended journal consumed by one Herdr reserve
    Submitted --> [*]
    NextHead --> [*]: deduplicated visible failure notice
